# Keeps this directory in the repository.
#
# `tauri.conf.json` declares `bundle.resources: ["binaries/"]`, and Tauri's build script
# validates that path while running `cargo check` — not only at bundle time. CI checks
# the shell without building the 46 MiB sidecar, so the directory has to exist and the
# binary inside it does not.
#
# `desktop/sidecar/build.py` writes `soapbot-backend.exe` here after freezing it.
